<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EQUIPMENT AVAILABILITY &amp; PLANNING</p><h1>Shop timeline</h1><p class="text-secondary">Future requests are planned at item-type level until serialized assets are pulled. Overdue assets remain committed until resolved.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" data-pdf="timeline" data-entity-id="0">Timeline PDF</button></div>
